  ('Receptionist', 'GB', "The full price is ninety-five pounds for the eight weeks. There's a reduced price for people over sixty, which is seventy pounds, and for students, which is fifty."),
  ('Caller', 'AU', "I turned sixty-two last month, so I think that's me."),
  ('Receptionist', 'GB', "Then it's seventy pounds. There's also a course book, which costs twelve pounds. You'll need it from the first week, although some people borrow a copy from the library instead."),
